{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2022-12-07 16:26:00', 'title': 'ARLINGTON CAPITAL PARTNERS AGREES TO SELL OCTO TO IBM', 'text': 'WASHINGTON--( BUSINESS WIRE )--ARLINGTON CAPITAL PARTNERS (“ARLINGTON CAPITAL”), A WASHINGTON, DC-BASED PRIVATE EQUITY FIRM, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS AGREED TO SELL OCTO (THE “COMPANY”) TO IBM (NYSE: IBM). OCTO, HEADQUARTERED IN RESTON, VA, IS A PURE-PLAY DIGITAL MODERNIZATION SOLUTIONS PROVIDER TO THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT.'}{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2022-12-07 16:15:00', 'title': 'IBM TO ACQUIRE OCTO', 'text': "ACQUISITION TO BRING OCTO'S EXPERTISE AND AGILITY TOGETHER WITH IBM'S REACH AND SCALE TO HELP ACCELERATE U.S. FEDERAL GOVERNMENT DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION ARMONK, N.Y. , DEC. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IBM (NYSE: IBM) TODAY ANNOUNCED AN AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE OCTO, A U.S.-BASED IT MODERNIZATION AND DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION SERVICES PROVIDER EXCLUSIVELY SERVING THE U.S. FEDERAL GOVERNMENT, INCLUDING DEFENSE, HEALTH, AND CIVILIAN AGENCIES."}